---
// Volt's architecture as the showcase cast. The art is the rest pose of the character components
// in the private volt-hq/volt-showcase-video repository (src/characters/*.tsx), which share one
// 1920x1080 frame with the floor at y=840. Each figure crops a 460-unit-wide column around its
// character so the four stand on one continuous floor line.
